# Bite Down has Bot1's face-down creature, cast with Illusionary Mask, deal damage equal to its power - the face-down 2/2's 2,
# determined as the instruction is carried out (CR 608.2h) - to Bot2's Grizzly Bears. That damage would be dealt by it: instead
# it is turned face up and deals that damage (CR 614.1, 614.6). It is Caelorna, Coral Tyrant, a 0/8, and the Bears still die:
# the event is the 2 damage, not a new one of its power now.

[Bot1 Deck]
Illusionary Mask
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Sapphire
Mox Sapphire
Caelorna, Coral Tyrant
Mox Emerald
Bite Down
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Grizzly Bears
Forest x20

